In the long run (post GA), maybe we can introduce an extra property in `EmbeddingOptions` that checks if batching is enabled and only then [this code ](https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-ai/blob/main/spring-ai-model/src/main/java/org/springframework/ai/embedding/EmbeddingModel.java#L87) calls the batching strategy.

