@amritansh-sap I imagine you're talking about using:
- MCP Server (likely async?)
- With Webflux
- With `@Tool` or `@McpTool` annotations

In that case, you need two things:

```java
var transport = WebFluxStreamableServerTransportProvider.builder()
    .objectMapper(new ObjectMapper())
    .messageEndpoint(CUSTOM_MESSAGE_ENDPOINT)
    .contextExtractor((request) -> {
        var authz = obtainAuthorizationFromRequest(req);
