WebFluxStreamableHttpTransport transport = WebFluxStreamableHttpTransport
    .builder("http://your-mcp-server.com")
    .endpoint("/api")
    .customizeRequest(builder -> {
        builder.header("X-Dynamic-Value", generateDynamicValue());
    })
    .build();

// 2. Build the MCP client
McpAsyncClient mcpAsyncClient = McpClient.async(transport)
    .requestTimeout(Duration.ofSeconds(60))
    .build();

// 3. Build the ChatClient
ChatClient.create(chatModel)
    .toolCallbacks(AsyncMcpToolCallbackProvider.builder().mcpClients(mcpAsyncClient).build())
    .user(message)
    .stream()
    .content();
```

