Hi,

Is there a different validation/mapping for McpTool calls compared to a spring http endpoint?

Imagine we have this normal http endpoint:

    @PostMapping("/helloWorld")
    public String helloWorld(@Valid @RequestBody HelloWorldDto request) {
        //...
